---
title: "C24 — Seven CI lanes and release gates · Implemented"
---
flowchart TD
  Trigger[PR, main push or manual workflow] --> Build[Workspace build]
  Trigger --> Lint[Workspace lint plus commitlint and Actionlint]
  Trigger --> Test[Workspace test]
  Trigger --> Types[Workspace typecheck]
  Trigger --> Format[Workspace format check]
  Trigger --> Prod[Compose production check]
  Trigger --> Dev[Compose live-update check]
  Build --> Join[Both matrices must pass]
  Lint --> Join
  Test --> Join
  Types --> Join
  Format --> Join
  Prod --> Join
  Dev --> Join
  Join --> MainOnly{Non-PR main run?}
  MainOnly -->|Yes| Publish[Publish affected apps]
  MainOnly -->|No| Complete[PR checks complete]
  Publish --> Enabled{CD_ENABLED true?}
  Enabled -->|Yes| Legacy[Existing legacy preview adapter]
  Enabled -->|No| Skip[Deployment skipped]
